    labelBoxBkgColor: "#fdfcf9"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#4a5568"
    labelTextColor: "#1a2332"
    loopTextColor: "#1a2332"
    activationBkgColor: "#10b981"
    activationBorderColor: "#4a5568"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Node as OSS Node
    participant EntitlementSvc as Entitlement Provider<br/>(Cloud)
    participant Registry as Paid Registry
    participant MeteringSvc as Metering Service

    Note over User,MeteringSvc: Entitlement Check & Metering Flow

    User->>Node: ctxt search --registry premium<br/>"advanced patterns"

    Node->>Node: Check local policy:<br/>Is registry access gated?

    alt Access requires entitlement
        Node->>EntitlementSvc: GET /api/v1/entitlements/check<br/>?user_id=user-123<br/>&resource=registry:premium<br/>&operation=read

        activate EntitlementSvc

        EntitlementSvc->>EntitlementSvc: Check user subscription
        EntitlementSvc->>EntitlementSvc: Check credit balance

        alt User has access
            EntitlementSvc-->>Node: 200 OK<br/>{<br/>  "granted": true,<br/>  "credits_remaining": 45,<br/>  "expires_at": "..."<br/>}
        else User lacks access
            EntitlementSvc-->>Node: 403 Forbidden<br/>{<br/>  "granted": false,<br/>  "reason": "insufficient_credits"<br/>}
            Node-->>User: ❌ Access denied:<br/>insufficient credits
            Note over Node: Flow ends here
        end

        deactivate EntitlementSvc
    end

    Node->>Registry: GET /bookmarks?q=advanced+patterns<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...

    Registry-->>Node: 200 OK (results)

    Node->>MeteringSvc: POST /api/v1/metering/events<br/>{<br/>  "user_id": "user-123",<br/>  "resource": "registry:premium",<br/>  "operation": "read",<br/>  "quantity": 1,<br/>  "timestamp": "..."<br/>}

    activate MeteringSvc
    MeteringSvc->>MeteringSvc: Record usage
    MeteringSvc->>MeteringSvc: Decrement user credits
    MeteringSvc-->>Node: 200 OK
    deactivate MeteringSvc

    Node-->>User: Display results

    Note over User,MeteringSvc: OSS node enforces policy.<br/>Cloud handles billing logic.
```
